{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/hm-land-registry-chairs-response-to-the-parliamentary-under-secretary-of-state","content_id":"5918d8d0-521b-4f4f-aab1-0364078c2061","description":"This is the Chair's response to the Government’s expectations and priorities for HM Land Registry over the coming year.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9218123","isbn":"","title":"HM Land Registry Chair's response","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/hm-land-registry-chairs-response-to-the-parliamentary-under-secretary-of-state/hm-land-registry-chairs-response"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"customersupport@mail.landregistry.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"69cbe36ca60a12ca3913c66a","filename":"HM_Land_Registry_Chair_s_response_to_Baroness_Taylor.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":189469,"filename":"HM_Land_Registry_Chair_s_response_to_Baroness_Taylor.pdf","id":"9218915","isbn":"","number_of_pages":3,"title":"HM Land Registry Chair's response","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69cbe36ca60a12ca3913c66a/HM_Land_Registry_Chair_s_response_to_Baroness_Taylor.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/hm-land-registry-chairs-letter-202627\">Baroness Taylor of Stevenage, Parliamentary Under-Secretary of State at the Ministry of Housing, Communities and Local Government, has written to the Chair of the HM Land Registry Board, Neil Sachdev</a>, to set out her priorities for HM Land Registry in delivering their role in registering and protecting land and property ownership and supporting an efficient property market.</p>\n\n<p>A Chair’s letter is issued annually to ensure there is a clear set of expectations of HM Land Registry’s leadership. This letter includes a number of key areas of focus for HM Land Registry to support the government’s policy priorities, missions and Plan for Change.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-31T16:49:21Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;navigation&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;attachment&quot;}\" href=\"/government/publications/hm-land-registry-chairs-response-to-the-parliamentary-under-secretary-of-state/hm-land-registry-chairs-response\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image--html\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 99 140\" width=\"99\" height=\"140\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <path d=\"M30,95h57v9H30V95z M30,77v9h39v-9H30z M30,122h48v-9H30V122z M12,68h9v-9h-9V68z M12,104h9v-9h-9V104z M12,86h9v-9h-9V86z M12,122h9v-9h-9V122z M87,12v27H12V12H87z M33,17h-4v8h-6v-8h-4v18h4v-7l6,0v7l4,0V17z M49,17H35l0,3h5v15h4V20l5,0V17z M68,17h-4 l-5,6l-5-6h-4v18h4l0-12l5,6l5-6l0,12h4V17z M81,32h-6V17h-4v18h10V32z M30,68h57v-9H30V68z\" stroke-width=\"0\" />\n</svg>\n\n</a></div>\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__details\">\n    <h2 class=\"gem-c-attachment__title\">\n      <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;navigation&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;attachment&quot;}\" href=\"/government/publications/hm-land-registry-chairs-response-to-the-parliamentary-under-secretary-of-state/hm-land-registry-chairs-response\">HM Land Registry Chair&#39;s response</a>\n</h2>\n\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute